# --- Downloaded open data ----------------------------------------------------
# Large (~110 MB) and fully reproducible with `make data`. Not committed.
data/raw/
data/cache/

# BUT the derived artifacts below ARE committed, deliberately.
#
# Together they are about 10 MB, and they are the difference between a repo that
# runs on `git clone && make install && make serve` and one that first needs
# network access to four open-data APIs and ~6 minutes of rebuild. A reviewer, a
# judge, a CI runner and a container build all want the former. `make data`,
# `make train` and `make regions` regenerate every one of them from source.
!data/processed/
!ml/artifacts/

